table": true, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 2, "received_works": [{"path": "/@OPQRSTUV_chan/works/25", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3530724, "client_id": 1264124, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0786f9e2/uploads/origins/622c62e8-47b5-45a9-8eb6-4bcde73ef90a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=923b3f5b02d054731fe097ffb0fb6fee", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0786f9e2/uploads/origins/622c62e8-47b5-45a9-8eb6-4bcde73ef90a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b837825f10a2172038bf5deb7a11aaa", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして\n絵がとてもきれいでかわいい\n本当に大好きです\n\nオリキャラのイラストをお願いしたいです。\n\n▷ オリキャラ詳細\n\n-彼女は16歳。\n-髪の色は白、目の色は青。\n-身長は154cm、体型は小柄。\n-胸はとても小さいので、平らな胸で描いてください。\n\n-彼女はとても親切で優しい女の子で、明るい一面もあります。\n\n参考資料\nhttps://sta.sh/2im3r6zmza0\n\n\nできれば私のオリキャラをかわいい表情で描いてください。\nそれ以外は自由に描いてください。\n\nよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@OPQRSTUV_chan/works/24", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3530724, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5c733870/uploads/origins/1989b529-c384-40de-a3b4-ad6f686210d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52fb83153b1a6e09789f3399991fd440", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5c733870/uploads/origins/1989b529-c384-40de-a3b4-ad6f686210d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=235184012cdbe3434fa045e546eb9263", "src_set": ""}, "body": "おーぱーつ。さんはじめまして！\n絵柄とても好きなのでリクエスト送らせていただきます🎶\nもしよければわたしのOCを書いていただけないでしょうか？？\n\n表情、髪型、構図、描写範囲などとくに指定はなく\n服装はイエローのワンピース（衣装デザインはお任せ致します！）\nフリルたっぷりのものだと嬉しいです！\n髪色に差がありますが、URLのコミッション1のイラストが1番近いです。（赤茶色）\n\nキャラクターシートに使用したいので、白背景または背景透過のものいただけますと幸いです。\n\n\n使用用途\nSNSアイコンや投稿\n他の絵師様への参考資料としてのドライブ保存\nキャラクターシート\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dEeBkdxb07Jo4ONY_VuxLs0B7-iGTqJl", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@OPQRSTUV_chan/works/23", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3530724, "client_id": 2772950, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c6bfb42a/uploads/origins/499de110-af32-479f-837f-7ed3cb759820?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e0eceb7545808c5c7ef4f0436a524ec", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c6bfb42a/uploads/origins/499de110-af32-479f-837f-7ed3cb759820?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c523d9d90b7f073d14debb8643dc9226", "src_set": ""}, "body": "おーぱーつ様、初めまして！\nおーぱーつ様の緩さや温かさを感じる、可愛い絵柄がとても好みでしたので、リクエスト失礼いたします✧\n\nhttps://x.com/opqrstuv_chan/status/1891491439860679068?s=46&t=9J7oICpEYUnvvNz_4kUM6A\n\nXにて投稿されていたこちらのイラストのように、うちの子の横顔を描いていただくことは可能でしょうか？\nうちの子の詳細は資料URLをご参照ください！ご検討いただけましたら幸いです🌸よろしくお願いいたします(❁ᴗ͈ˬᴗ͈)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1O5n4evkK7OXIpb83doFeUtA-GSJ5uG41", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@OPQRSTUV_chan/works/22", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3530724, "client_id": 3173637, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/96a9dd23/uploads/origins/0a8d3476-da7f-4f49-a1d3-89e6555a2a85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=633ba7c7220ccff744895c2eeb52ad51", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/96a9dd23/uploads/origins/0a8d3476-da7f-4f49-a1d3-89e6555a2a85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e8ad84edc3a7410a49f9d989a6a76bb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、アキです。お願いがあります！私のキャラクター、パンドラをあなたのスタイルでお願いします。胸が大きくて、歯がとがっていて、耳が大きい、かわいいゴブリンの女の子です。とても背が低い（132cm）。彼女は二丁拳銃を振り回し、時間を止める力を持っている。好きなように描いてください。リクエストに応えてくれてありがとう！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OOTwkQdAK5Bg1srE7_275t8hJo82cq0d", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@OPQRSTUV_chan/works/21", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/de48c4e2/uploads/origins/7ce77f27-4345-4c74-81ee-13e6e744d2d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=64b72f9ffb026035f52d0d788ed75fc4", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3530724, "client_id": 2667685, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@OPQRSTUV_chan/works/20", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3530724, "client_id": 2481432, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3535df0/uploads/origins/7e219ab6-0c45-4f05-b4be-bca50dc60f1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4e68841214f106ba63e03de18fc2a89", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3535df0/uploads/origins/7e219ab6-0c45-4f05-b4be-bca50dc60f1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=64fafee85f5ce20914ce6edd29e31895", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello. I would like to request a design of loli twins who are evil and malicious. They are 120-130cm tall at most. One twin wields a futuristic chainsaw, while the other wields a giant futuristic scissor. They serve as antagonists and boss battles to my character Rina. Their leotard outfit would have some similarities to Rina's, but can absorb blood to change color when a victim is cut by the twins. \n\nThe chainsaw twin has a personality of a male serial killer implanted in her, while the other twin is evil because of the other sister's influence growing up, being more calm in comparison but also has a childlike cruelty. I would like the chainsaw twin to wear a cybernetic eye patch. Their hair styles would be different as well. I'd like their eye colors to be red, with the hair color decided by you. \n\nFor reference, this will be the victim of the twins. Rina: https://files.catbox.moe/eyuuwk.jpg", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@OPQRSTUV_chan/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/08d42931/uploads/origins/dc1a64b1-2e1b-44d2-9973-f5bd472808d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=83b62909d8565f1872025d317a50a2f5", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3530724, "client_id": 3608366, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@OPQRSTUV_chan/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3530724, "client_i